{
 "_why": [
  "ICON REBASE - Ronaldo's card scheme applied to icons. Jakub's find.",
  "Ronaldo is ONE assetId + 8 revisions, so the client derives that one",
  "assetId and names every variation. An icon is four assetIds at",
  "revision 0, so each must be named alone and the client only knows",
  "some of them - which is the STOCKDALE / blank-name bug.",
  "",
  "Each player's LOWEST-rated version is the ANCHOR and is untouched;",
  "every other version is served as (revision << 24) | anchor_assetId.",
  "",
  "INVENTED: the resourceId, and nothing else. Player, rating, promo,",
  "shell, art, stats and position are exactly as the archive has them.",
  "fut22_specials.json is NEVER modified - this is applied at serve",
  "time by fut_special_item, and deleting this file reverts it.",
  "",
  "Regenerate with tools/iconrebase.py after any change to the",
  "specials archive, or the anchors may no longer match."
 ],
